Pin the publication-hold paragraph of the frame-transactions wire contract

Sophia 7ec29c59 documents that while a lean commit is in flight the host may
hold its source's successful ResourceStatus and release record back from
`events` reads until the frame's terminal is journaled. Spec copy and its
digest updated to the authoritative bytes; no client code changes.
